# Vanish from Sight: "Target nonland permanent's owner puts it on their choice of the top or bottom of their library. Surveil 1."
# Bot1 pays {3}{U} with four Moxen. A Mountain (a land) is refused as a target (CR 115.1). Bot2's Ornithopter is accepted: its owner
# Bot2 chooses the top (Accept) and draws it again in turn 4. Then Bot1 surveils 1 and puts the Forest into its graveyard.

